{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Power of Golden Slammer</strong>\u00a0is a game about being a kid in the 90s!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/POGS_Battle.gif?t=1749666260\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Riding your <strong>skateboard</strong> around different parts of town, battling other kids, mowing lawns to earn <strong>money</strong> to buy more <strong>slammers</strong> at the video store and <strong>collecting</strong> <i>rad</i> items like electronic LCD handheld games, slap bracelets and wearable items which increase your <strong>coolness</strong>!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/Header_SLAMMERS_POGS_PowerOfGoldenSlammer.png?t=1749666260\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Power of Golden Slammer doesn't just have SLAMMERS it has BLADE, HOLOGRAPHIC <i>and</i> <strong>HOLOGRAPHIC BLADE </strong>CAPS\u00a0<i>AND</i> SLAMMERS!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/POGS_Power_of_Golden_Slammer_Basketball_Margin2.gif?t=1749666260\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/BladePOGSharkGIFv3.gif?t=1749666260\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/HoloSlammerLipstickGIF.gif?t=1749666260\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/HoloBladeSlammerGIF.gif?t=1749666260\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may be wondering\u00a0\u201cHow does a battle actually work?\u201d To summarize,\u00a0<strong>the player and the opponent take turns slamming a stack of caps with their slammer and keep whichever caps flip over on their turn.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/POGS_SlamDividerPOGS95GIF.gif?t=1749666260\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During battle you have a limited number of turns and can either do a normal slam by using the \u201cSLAM\u201d button as it appears or you can use your one shot\u00a0<strong>SPECIAL SLAM</strong>\u00a0and attempt to\u00a0<strong>use the power of leverage to get a really sweet payout</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/Header_SKATEBOARDING_POGS_PowerOfGoldenSlammer.png?t=1749666260\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Skateboarding</strong> in P.O.G.S. is <strong>radical</strong>! With   lightning fast responsive movement and controls that allow you to turn on a dime , skate in third or first person and do <strong>impossible</strong> tricks.\u00a0<strong>GNARLY!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/POGS_Skateboarding_POG.gif?t=1749666260\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/Header_FASHION_POGS_PowerOfGoldenSlammer.png?t=1749666260\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Being <strong>cool</strong> is essential to gaining access to different parts of town.\u00a0Many wearable items directly affect your <strong>coolness</strong> level allowing you to impress your peers and even adults. <strong>WOAH!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/POGS_Fashion_POG.gif?t=1749666260\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/Header_FINANCE_POGS_PowerOfGoldenSlammer.png?t=1749666260\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These little cardboard circles with pictures on them are expensive! Good thing you're an industrious go getter. If you happen to be low on caps or just want to expand your collection you can do things like mow lawns for money to purchase caps and slammers at the video store. <strong>CHA-CHING!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/POGS_Finance_POG.gif?t=1749666260\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/Header_COLLECTIBLES_POGS_PowerOfGoldenSlammer.png?t=1749666260\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During your idyllic summer vacation as a P.O.G.S. kid you will collect cool wearable items, toys and of <i>course</i>\u00a0<strong>rare</strong> caps and slammers. P.O.G.S. already features <strong>many items</strong> suggested by <strong>90s enthusiasts</strong>\u00a0(check the discussions) and <strong>we're only getting started</strong>!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/POGSCollectiblesPOGgif.gif?t=1749666260\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/POGS_SlamDividerPOGS95GIF.gif?t=1749666260\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Thank you so much for your interest in Power of Golden Slammer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><br><br>See you at the video store!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/PageBottomVideoStore_1280.png?t=1749666260\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3640790?t=1749666260","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/174bd38c298c1da07f56d58add7e97307cf4313e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749666260","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/5de1fba41e09f24dbe897b47ee3a20dbd28b15f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749666260","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/5de1fba41e09f24dbe897b47ee3a20dbd28b15f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749666260","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3713930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Power of Golden Slammer</strong>\u00a0is a game about being a kid in the 90s!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/POGS_Battle.gif?t=1749666260\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Riding your <strong>skateboard</strong> around different parts of town, battling other kids, mowing lawns to earn <strong>money</strong> to buy more <strong>slammers</strong> at the video store and <strong>collecting</strong> <i>rad</i> items like electronic LCD handheld games, slap bracelets and wearable items which increase your <strong>coolness</strong>!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/Header_SLAMMERS_POGS_PowerOfGoldenSlammer.png?t=1749666260\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Power of Golden Slammer doesn't just have SLAMMERS it has BLADE, HOLOGRAPHIC <i>and</i> <strong>HOLOGRAPHIC BLADE </strong>CAPS\u00a