ng> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/POGS_Skateboarding_POG.gif?t=1749666260\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/Header_FASHION_POGS_PowerOfGoldenSlammer.png?t=1749666260\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Being <strong>cool</strong> is essential to gaining access to different parts of town.\u00a0Many wearable items directly affect your <strong>coolness</strong> level allowing you to impress your peers and even adults. <strong>WOAH!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/POGS_Fashion_POG.gif?t=1749666260\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/Header_FINANCE_POGS_PowerOfGoldenSlammer.png?t=1749666260\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These little cardboard circles with pictures on them are expensive! Good thing you're an industrious go getter. If you happen to be low on caps or just want to expand your collection you can do things like mow lawns for money to purchase caps and slammers at the video store. <strong>CHA-CHING!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/POGS_Finance_POG.gif?t=1749666260\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/Header_COLLECTIBLES_POGS_PowerOfGoldenSlammer.png?t=1749666260\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During your idyllic summer vacation as a P.O.G.S. kid you will collect cool wearable items, toys and of <i>course</i>\u00a0<strong>rare</strong> caps and slammers. P.O.G.S. already features <strong>many items</strong> suggested by <strong>90s enthusiasts</strong>\u00a0(check the discussions) and <strong>we're only getting started</strong>!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/POGSCollectiblesPOGgif.gif?t=1749666260\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/POGS_SlamDividerPOGS95GIF.gif?t=1749666260\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Thank you so much for your interest in Power of Golden Slammer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><br><br>See you at the video store!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/PageBottomVideoStore_1280.png?t=1749666260\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","developers":["https://steamcommunity.com/groups/powerofgoldenslammer","https://powerofgoldenslammer.com"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/4a822c57d8c871fc3d89df54cefdfa2fbec3b684/header.jpg?t=1749666260","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257122010,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122010/movie480.mp4?t=1749666255","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122010/movie_max.mp4?t=1749666255"},"name":"Power of Golden Slammer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257122010/e3601ad83d44364e839f19ab1ec1f92dc00160ef/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749666255","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/